						<a href="/forum/t-13899160/a-deconstruction-of-the-foundations-modus-operandi-scp">A Deconstruction of the Foundations Modus Operandi (SCP)</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4840311">
									

<p>This does feel too much like a zombie plague to me&#8230; yeah they're not undead but otherwise its similar</p>
<blockquote>
<p>We discover that SCP-1609 (and many others) are completely fabricated. They don't exist. They are nothing but Foundation propaganda, a way to convince Foundation personnel that the GOC are incompetent and the Foundations way is the correct way… the only way, to deal with the anomalous. Moreover, they serve as a warning to those who would try to preemptively neutralise an anomalous object.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><em>I feel like a new SCP author's article should depend on other articles quite this much without seeming like you are trying to gain credibility by latching onto those other articles&#8230; also, not a big fan of this concept, as all of these things were classified so its not like they're cover stories&#8230; only those cleared for each would know of them. Its like a cover from a very small niche group of people&#8230;</em></p>
<hr />
<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Also, as a Jewish man, I am uncomfortable with this stuff</span></strong>:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Due to the anti-Semitic slur scorched into the corpse's chest, Foundation historians have theorised that the corpse was murdered due to the Christian persecution of the Jewish populace admist the onset of the Bubonic Plague.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>&amp;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>it is implied the phenomenon manifested due to the lynching of the poor Jewish gentlemen, who was repeatedly burned as a form of torture. The reason why the infection can only be destroyed through incineration is because those that killed Parisian Man used fire to burn him, even though he wasn't infected.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Are you Jewish? Because honestly this level of grindhouse torture porn stuff based on anti-semitic violence for the sake of entertainment is&#8230; just a bad look personally.</p>

							</div>

								
					
